+/* RSX fragment temps alias: the fp32 register R[n] and the fp16 registers
+ * H[2n], H[2n+1] are the same 128 bits. R[n].x holds H[2n].x (low half) and
+ * H[2n].y (high half), R[n].y H[2n].zw, R[n].z H[2n+1].xy, R[n].w
